			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Project-local copy of stock Device:RotaryEncoder_Switch (pilink-2ar) -- same A/B/C/S1/S2 pins and graphics, plus one added pin \"MP\" for the footprint's two mounting/shield pads (RotaryEncoder_Alps_EC11E-Switch_Vertical_H20mm's two thru-hole pads both named \"MP\", which both bind to a single same-numbered schematic pin -- standard KiCad multi-pad-per-pin convention). A copy rather than an in-place edit of the stock symbol, to avoid the 'symbol modified in library' ERC/library-sync state this project has previously flagged and reverted (see rp2350b_memory.kicad_sch's W25Q128JVS note). MP is tied to GND on SW303: Alps' EC11E18244AU datasheet (datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/00ace576d31da40a390056171db2037f.pdf) was not readable as extractable text in this agent environment (same no-pdftotext/poppler-utils gap already flagged for this part elsewhere in this project), so this follows general mounting-tab practice (grounding an otherwise-floating metal tab/shield is the standard, safer default for ESD/EMI) rather than a datasheet-confirmed pin-9-style thermal/ground spec -- flag for human re-verification against the real datasheet before fab."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
